    "long_instructions": "## Debug the Pet Care Simulator\r\n\r\n1. Click each button and observe how the pet’s state changes.\r\n2. Compare what happens to what the hints say *should* happen.\r\n3. Find bugs where the state:\r\n   - doesn’t change  \r\n   - changes the wrong way  \r\n   - resets  \r\n   - behaves strangely  \r\n   - shows the wrong value  \r\n4. Record each bug in `documentation.md`.\r\n5. Fix the code in `script.js` and test again. Each time AI generates code, ask:\r\n    - Is the output what I asked for?\r\n    - Does it work?\r\n    - Can I explain it?",
    "display_name": "Pet Care Simulator",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/c1ebf5692e8a92a439a03382e4ab0d75-dog.png",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Take care of a virtual pet by managing its energy, hunger, and mood. Debug how each action changes the pet’s state over time.",
